00:05:13.968 --> 00:05:15.701
[ Applause ]

00:05:18.434 --> 00:05:22.067
Next headline was...

00:05:22.067 --> 00:05:25.767
Headline could have been...

00:05:25.767 --> 00:05:27.267
[ Applause ]

00:05:27.267 --> 00:05:30.667
I would see that.
I would see that tomorrow.

00:05:30.667 --> 00:05:32.767
[ Steve laughs ]

00:05:32.767 --> 00:05:36.968
Next headline was...

00:05:36.968 --> 00:05:41.067
Headline could have been...

00:05:41.067 --> 00:05:43.000
[ Applause ]

00:05:43.000 --> 00:05:46.534
