00:06:25.367 --> 00:06:27.868
"Huh? Huh? Huh?"

00:06:27.868 --> 00:06:30.367
[ Applause ]

00:06:30.367 --> 00:06:34.434
And finally,
this headline was...

00:06:34.434 --> 00:06:37.601
